# 行尾统一：仓库内部一律 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 之间来回提交产生「整文件改动」
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd / PowerShell 可能执行异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换、不做文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.db-shm binary
*.db-wal binary
